<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Maintenance Request Confirmation</title>
    {{> styles }}
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <img src="https://i.imgur.com/SkOGGbd.png" alt="Company Logo">
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h1>Maintenance Request Confirmed!</h1>
            <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
            <p>Jai Sadguru Dev Vandan! We have received your request for maintenance as per following details:</p>
            <div class="details">
                <p><strong>Requestor Phone Number:</strong> {{mobno}}</p>
                <p><strong>Request Detail:</strong> {{detail}}</p>
                <p><strong>Place of Work:</strong> {{work}}</p>
            </div>
            <p>We will review your request and update the status on the portal.</p>
            <p>If you have any questions or need further assistance, please feel free to contact us at <b>+91-7875432613 / +91-9004273512</b>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2025 SRATRC. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
